diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7765fed..76b0830 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -56,6 +56,13 @@ Database-backed job queue (no Redis):
 
 Recurring tasks are declared in `config/recurring.yml`.
 
+### Notification email digests
+
+Notifications are emailed in batches rather than one by one:
+- Each person picks how often with `bundle_email_frequency` on their settings: `never`, `every_few_hours`, `daily` or `weekly`.
+- `Notification::EmailBundle` holds one window per person. It opens when the first notification lands, is emailed once it ends, and never overlaps the previous window.
+- Deliveries are scheduled when a window opens and swept by `Notification::DeliverDueEmailBundlesJob` in case a scheduled delivery got lost.
+
 ### Sharded Full-Text Search
 
 Full-text search runs in the database, not Elasticsearch. On MySQL it is sharded 16 ways by CRC32 of the account ID (`Search::Record::Trilogy`); on SQLite it is a single FTS5 index (`Search::Record::SQLite`). Don't assume the sharded shape when working under SQLite. Models in `app/models/search/`.
